# Strategy Definitions (RDF Types)
ex:Strat_단어의_나무 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "단어의 나무"@ko .
ex:Strat_낱말_접사_만들기 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "낱말 접사 만들기"@ko .
ex:Strat_손_그리기_활동 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "손 그리기 활동"@ko .
ex:Strat_감정표 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "감정표"@ko .
ex:Strat_개념_정의_지도그리기 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "개념 정의 지도그리기"@ko .
ex:Strat_LEAD_어휘연습 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "LEAD 어휘연습"@ko .
ex:Strat_밑줄_긋기 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "밑줄 긋기"@ko .
