ex:Strat_SQ3R a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "SQ3R"@ko .
ex:Strat_과학책_훑어보기 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "과학책 훑어보기"@ko .
ex:Strat_미리보기 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "미리보기"@ko .
ex:Strat_앙케이트_질문표 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "앙케이트/질문표"@ko .
ex:Strat_질문의_답은_어디에_QAR a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "질문의 답은 어디에(QAR)"@ko .
