ex:Strat_A_QU_A a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "A-QU-A"@ko .
ex:Strat_어휘_예상하기 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "어휘 예상하기"@ko .
ex:Strat_사진_속으로 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "사진 속으로"@ko .
ex:Strat_상상_속으로 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "상상 속으로"@ko .
ex:Strat_벤다이어그램 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "벤다이어그램"@ko .
ex:Strat_의미자질_분석하기 a ex:ReadingStrategy ; rdfs:label "의미자질 분석하기"@ko .
